<Page title={"Corrections"} description={"Corrections policy of romainblachier.fr: factual errors are corrected and dated transparently, with a simple way to report a mistake."} lang="en">
	<h1 class="page-title">Corrections</h1>
	<p class="page-lede">Report an error, request a correction.</p>
	<div class="page-body">
<p>Accuracy is a priority. To report a factual error, email <a href="mailto:romain.blachier@gmail.com">romain.blachier@gmail.com</a> with the relevant URL.</p>
<h2>Process</h2>
<ul>
<li>Significant corrections are noted at the bottom of the article with their date.</li>
<li>Minor typos are fixed without a note.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Corrections log</h2>
<p>No corrections published to date.</p>
	</div>
</Page>
